  "scope": "SAF-K8S-1001-030 uses one runner-owned kind v1.36.1 cluster and the saf-test namespace. A Job, a Service-backed running Pod, and a staged pipeline Job each write one fixed synthetic JSON event to container stdout. A case-owned collector ServiceAccount gets only pods/log for the three exact fixture Pod names and posts those records to a case-owned route and receiver. The case checks the missing route, enables the fixture route, then independently compares collected records with host-side kubectl logs. It does not test a production collector, enterprise backend, log retention, source completeness beyond these three fixtures, or real AI systems.",
